### 1. List Users (Paginated & Sorted) 
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users?page=0&size=5&sortBy=id&sortDir=asc 
Accept: application/json 
### 2. Search Users by Keyword 
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/search?keyword=john 
Accept: application/json 
### 3. Get User by ID 
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/1 
Accept: application/json 
### 4. Create New User (Valid Request) 
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users 
Content-Type: application/json 
{ 
} 
  "firstName": "Michael", 
  "lastName": "Scott", 
  "email": "michael.scott@dundermifflin.com", 
  "username": "mscott", 
  "phone": "+15551234567", 
  "role": "MANAGER", 
  "active": true 
### 5. Create User (Invalid - Triggers 400 Bad Request) 
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users 
Content-Type: application/json 
{ 
} 
  "firstName": "", 
  "lastName": "", 
  "email": "not-an-email", 
  "username": "ab", 
  "role": null 
### 6. Update User Details 
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/users/1 
Content-Type: application/json 
{ 
} 
  "firstName": "John", 
  "lastName": "Doe Updated", 
  "email": "john.doe@example.com", 
  "username": "johndoe", 
  "phone": "+1234567890", 
  "role": "ADMIN", 
  "active": true 
### 7. Soft Delete User 
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/users/1 